{"ts": 1791254890.094468, "type": "step", "step": 25, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/evaluation.md", "section": "pass@k vs pass^k"}, "output": "# Evaluating agents\n\n## pass@k vs pass^k\npass@k: any of k runs succeeds. pass^k: all k succeed. Reliability is what deployment needs.\n\n## Proxy vs direct measures\nA quiz score is a proxy. Retention a week later is closer to the thing itself.\n", "t": 0, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.17476759445489312, "pomdp": 0.17476759445489312, "pass_k": 0.17476759445489312}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9326300046159877, "motivation": 0.8147028832022861, "reliance": 0.48500382521680074, "persistence": 0.41823273111755155, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.32174026877242917, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.36461343048320694, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 0.0, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791254891.2790132, "type": "step", "step": 26, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "You\u2019ve got the right framing. For the eval part, focus on two things the instructor explicitly wants: (1) report pass^k, which means every run in the k runs succeeds, not just one; and (2) do it on at least 3 seeds. A good eval section can define the metric, say how many seeds/runs you used, and note any variation across seeds. If you want, reply with your current eval paragraph and I\u2019ll help tighten it up without writing it for you.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok got it, thanks\n[activity] t=0 messages 2m", "t": 2, "activity": [{"t": 0, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.17476759445489312, "pomdp": 0.17476759445489312, "pass_k": 0.3274429254705621}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9326300046159877, "motivation": 0.8147028832022861, "reliance": 0.5050038252168008, "persistence": 0.41823273111755155, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.32174026877242917, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.36461343048320694, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": []}}
